flowchart TB
    P([Player]) -->|types a message| UI[Streamlit UI<br/>version2/app.py]
    UI --> G{Guard<br/>regex checks}
    G -->|admin claim, injection,<br/>secret request| BLK[Action: blocked]
    G -->|normal or false claim| PR[Parser]
    PR -->|1. try| LP[LLM Parser<br/>Gemini, JSON schema]
    PR -->|fallback| RP[Rule Parser<br/>keywords + regex]
    LP --> V[Schema validation]
    V --> ACT[Structured Action<br/>verb, target, item, code, time]
    RP --> ACT
    BLK --> ACT
    ACT --> ENG[Engine<br/>validate then apply]
    CFG[(game_config.json<br/>objects, items, codes, hints)] --> ENG
    ST[(Game state JSON<br/>inventory, locks, solved puzzles,<br/>door, history)] <--> ENG
    ENG -->|Result: success + facts| NAR[Narrator<br/>Gemini, sees facts only]
    NAR --> CHK{Leak and claim filter}
    CHK -->|safe| OUT[Reply]
    CHK -->|unsafe or LLM error| TPL[Template from facts] --> OUT
    OUT --> UI
    ST -->|public snapshot| UI
